shu-088-song88:p002:m0008"]},{"surface":"景徵","mention_ids":["c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0004"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-088","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-song88","source_id":"s-songshu-088-song88-ws2069210","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002","quote":"景微","mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-088","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-xueandu","source_id":"s-songshu-088-xueandu-ws2069210","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002","quote":"景徵","mention_id":"c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0004"}],"identity_note":"《宋書》卷八十八崔道固傳作景微，薛安都傳作景徵。兩處同為道固遣子與傅靈越赴安都。魏書、北史另記歸魏與襲爵的景徽，兩組同指待核。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","source_assertion_id":"a-songshu-088-song88-m0008-child-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-088","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-song88","source_id":"s-songshu-088-song88-ws2069210","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002","quote":"景和元年，出為寧朔將軍、冀州刺史，鎮歷城。泰始二年，進號輔國將軍，又進號征虜將軍。時徐州刺史薛安都同逆，上即還道固本號為徐州代之。道固不受命，遣子景微、軍主傅靈越率眾赴安都。既而為土人起義所攻，屢戰失利，閉門自守。會四方平定，上遣使宣慰，道固奉詔歸順。先是與沈文秀共引虜，虜既至，固守距之，因被圍逼。虜每進，輒為道固所摧。三年，以為都督冀青兗幽并五州諸軍事、前將軍、冀州刺史，加節，又進號平北將軍。其年，為虜所陷，被送桑乾，死於虜中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0000","source_term":"子景微"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"本傳明載道固之子景微。同卷薛安都傳同一事書景徵，各存原字。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-songshu-088-song88-ws2069210","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-088","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-song88","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008"],"paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-088-song88:p002"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008","mention_ids":["c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0008"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mentio